OL,3,GNEWSACommunity support needed to save
OL,4,Apub
OL,5,
OL,6,FPub owners in Cornwall have been
OL,7,Fsharing the importance of prioritising
OL,8,Fthe community.
OL,10,FIn 2022, campaigners raised about
OL,11,F#500,000 to enable the Prince of Wales
OL,12,Fpub in Newtown-in-St-Martin, near
OL,13,FHelford, to become a community-owned
OL,14,Festablishment.
OL,16,FDavid Lambrick, one of three tenants,
OL,17,Fsaid: "It took a huge amount of work to
OL,18,Factually do it, going backwards and
OL,19,Fforwards, solicitors and... finding the
OL,20,Fmoney to actually buy it."
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
