OL,3,GNEWSACommunity support needed to save
OL,4,Apub
OL,5,
OL,6,FSam Fitch, who has been working to save
OL,7,Fthe Stag Hunt pub in Ponsanooth, and is
OL,8,Ffacing a fundraising deadline at the
OL,9,Fend of the week, said saving such a
OL,10,Fplace was important as it was the
OL,11,F"heart of the village".
